    text: "Affected stops:\r\n15th St & Cleveland Pl (#17698) (eastbound)\r\n15th St & Welton St [ Z Stop ] (#17701) (eastbound)\r\n15th St & Champa St [ Z Stop ] (#17704) (eastbound)\r\nCurtis St & 16th Street (#17747) (eastbound)\r\nCurtis St & 18th St (#22700) (eastbound)\r\nCurtis St & 20th St (#22701) (eastbound)\r\nChampa St & 19th St (#21166) (westbound)\r\nChampa St & 18th St (#21167) (westbound)\r\n17th St & California St [ Z Stop ] (#17712) (westbound)\r\n\nFor eastbound Route 48 get on/off buses at:\r\nCivic Center Station Gate 3 (#35033)\r\nCurtis St & 18th St (#22700)\r\nBroadway & Curtis St (#12505)\r\n\nFor westbound Route 48 get on/off buses at:\r\nBroadway & Curtis St (#12508)\r\nCivic Center Station (16th Drop-Off) (#35030)"
